                    <h4 class="fw-bold text-success">What is PharmaLink?</h4>
                    <p>PharmaLink is a digital platform that connects pharmacies with nearby users and customers. Our mission is to simplify the process of finding medicines and checking their availability at local pharmacies.</p>

                    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">Our Objectives</h5>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Simplify Medicine Searching</strong> - Search by scientific or commercial name</li>
                        <li><strong>Real-Time Availability</strong> - Check if medicines are available, low stock, or out of stock</li>
                        <li><strong>Price Transparency</strong> - View listed prices from different pharmacies</li>
                        <li><strong>Pharmacy Status</strong> - Know if a pharmacy is open or closed</li>
                        <li><strong>Improve Access</strong> - Find nearby pharmacies quickly</li>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="alert alert-info mt-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-info-circle me-2"></i>
                        <strong>Important:</strong> PharmaLink provides information about medicine availability and prices only. It does not provide medical diagnosis or treatment recommendations. Always consult a healthcare professional for medical advice.
                    </div>
